     1|/**
     2| * Owner-only distribution presign endpoint (APK/AAB releases + landing assets).
     3| *
     4| * Mints a short-lived (15 min) presigned S3 PUT URL restricted to either the
     5| * `apk/` prefix (release artifacts) or an explicit whitelist of top-level
     6| * landing-page files, so a build agent can upload WITHOUT AWS credentials
     7| * ever leaving the runtime.
     8| *
     9| * Guards:
    10| *  - Registered owner bearer required (assertIVXRegisteredOwnerBearer)
    11| *  - Explicit per-class confirmation phrase (409 without it):
    12| *      apk/<name>.(apk|aab)      -> CONFIRM_IVX_APK_UPLOAD
    13| *      landing whitelist file    -> CONFIRM_IVX_LANDING_UPLOAD
    14| *  - Secrets are never returned; only the signed URL is.
    15| */
